  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance capacity in food safety</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall target of the government-to-government (G2G) tailor-made Shiraka project is to enhance the capacity and effectiveness of Tunisia&apos;s National Food Safety Authority INSSPA in implementing and enforcing the Food and Feed Safety Law. This is aimed at aligning Tunisia&apos;s food safety regulations with European Union directives, thereby improving food safety, protecting consumers, and facilitating regional and global trade. The project seeks to address key challenges in staffing, training, and implementation by providing comprehensive online training courses and planning practical applications to ensure INSSPA staff can effectively carry out their supervisory and regulatory responsibilities.</narrative>
  </description>
